  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renewstable Barbados Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide a climate-resilient baseload solution that can be dispatched 24 hours a&#xa0;day using intermittent solar PV generation combined with battery&#xa0;and green hydrogen storage. 

&#x2022;First of its kind project that pursues an innovative solution combining BESS and green hydrogen technology as a baseload alternative for Barbados, creating a significant demonstration effect if successful as a reliable baseload solution for SIDS.
&#x2022; The project will reduce reliance of imported fossil fuel, contributing to the improvement of the economic resilience and energy security of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
